on_leg_update after the backstop filled 40: parent completed, the backstop filled, so the position is closed and the hidden stop stops watching
Backstop without a limit: HTTP 400, a backstop needs both backstop_price and backstop_limit_price: a stop-limit whose limit sits at its trigger will not fill when the price runs through it, which is what a backstop is for
